flowchart TD
  accTitle: Knowledge publication and retrieval readiness
  accDescr: Review content and privacy before publication, then index the current version and select it for an assistant. Retrieval checks business and surface access.
  U[Add source] --> R{Content and privacy reviewed?}
  R -->|No| D[Keep draft and resolve review]
  R -->|Yes| P[Publish approved version]
  P --> I{Current version indexed?}
  I -->|No| T[Inspect failed or stale index and retry]
  T --> I
  I -->|Yes| S[Select permitted resource in assistant]
  S --> G{Business and surface access allowed?}
  G -->|Yes| A[Eligible grounded retrieval]
  G -->|No| X[Resource unavailable for this use]
